---
import { yearsOfExperience } from "../../data/career";

const years = yearsOfExperience();
---

<div class="about">
  <p>
    I started on the phones in 2016, answering hosting support tickets. {years} years later I
    architect the infrastructure behind hundreds of banking websites. I'm self-taught: everything in
    between I learned from books, online courses, and running production systems.
  </p>
  <p>
    Security and data integrity drive most of my decisions. I design for failure first: two
    datacenters, failover that gets tested, and monitoring that pages before customers notice.
  </p>
  <p>
    I'd rather automate a task than do it twice, and I write things down so the next person doesn't
    have to guess. At work that means Ansible, CI/CD pipelines, and internal tools in Go and Python.
  </p>
  <p class="about__personal">
    Outside work I lift for my health, not for a platform, and I watch a lot of anime. Solo Leveling
    is why the ranks on this site are letters.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: var(--text-heading-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about__personal {
    color: var(--color-ash);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
  }
</style>
